  first | exact @GlobalTheory.SatInd.CosetFin.finite_inert_support | exact GlobalTheory.SatInd.CosetFin.finite_inert_support | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.SatInd.CosetFin.finite_inert_support <;> assumption)
